From 53c49372d95ba02fca3c712d14e53a18732f6c6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Helfgott <joshhelfgott@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:42:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix iPhone crashes mid-batch, drop always-on dot markers,
 remove Keep Solid

- Free full-size canvases as soon as they're used (iOS caps total canvas
  memory; leftovers made new canvases blank or killed the tab)
- Export preview reuses one canvas per image instead of rebuilding ~100 MB
  on every redraw
- Cap imported images at 6300 px on the long side (largest platen)
- Dot survey markers only drawn while Dot Cleanup is above 0, red only
- Color to Alpha: Keep Solid slider removed (fixed at 0 = plain C2A)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MLLuqCKDDsFmHGhTTXi81j
